flowchart TD
DecisionVars["**Decision Variables**<br/>Six buffer capacities for optimization<br/>post_loading post_conveyor post_washing pre_press1 pre_press2 post_press12<br/>discrete range {1-10}"]
Problem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Attributes n_var n_obj xl xu n_replications base_seed n_cores<br/>Methods _evaluate prepare tasks spawn multiprocessing pool collect F<br/>Role define mapping from decision X to objectives"]
NSGA2Algo["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Attributes pop_size sampling crossover mutation eliminate_duplicates<br/>Methods evolve population using Problem evaluations<br/>Role multi objective search"]
Minimizer["**Minimizer**<br/>Method minimize problem with algorithm and termination<br/>Returns optimization result with history and populations"]
MultiprocPool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>Attributes processes count<br/>Methods map evaluate_single_individual across population<br/>Role parallel evaluation of candidates"]
EvalInd["**evaluate_single_individual**<br/>Inputs candidate caps n_replications base_seed warmup measure_until<br/>Method run repeated simulations collect throughput and wip compute averages<br/>Outputs average wip and negative average throughput"]
RunSimCaps["**run_simulation_with_caps**<br/>Inputs seed caps warmup measure_until<br/>Method construct simpy environment create DelayBuffer instances with caps create Machine instances run warmup sample wip compute KPIs<br/>Outputs result dictionary overall and machine_energy"]
RunSim["**run_simulation**<br/>Baseline simulation using fixed buffer settings<br/>Method build env create machines buffers run warmup sample and measure KPIs"]
MachineClass["**Machine Class**<br/>Attributes name input_buffer output_buffer process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power capacity<br/>Methods run breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption reset stats<br/>Role event driven workstation in simulation"]
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer Class**<br/>Attributes cap delay store tokens in_transit<br/>Methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count<br/>Role models transport delay and capacity including in transit tokens"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>f1 average WIP minimize<br/>f2 throughput maximize implemented as negative for minimizer<br/>Used by evaluate and Problem"]
Result["**Optimization Result**<br/>Contains Pareto front history populations X and F<br/>Used by export and analysis"]
CSVExport["**CSV Exporter**<br/>Method export_history_to_csv read result history write generation individual decision variables and KPIs to CSV file results moo_simulation_results.csv"]
Main["**Main Script**<br/>Sets multiprocessing start method spawn<br/>Calls run_nsga2_optimization then export_history_to_csv<br/>Orchestrates full optimization run"]

DecisionVars --> Problem
Problem --> MultiprocPool
MultiprocPool --> EvalInd
EvalInd --> RunSimCaps
RunSimCaps --> DelayBufferClass
RunSimCaps --> MachineClass
EvalInd --> Objectives
MultiprocPool --> Problem
Problem --> NSGA2Algo
NSGA2Algo --> Minimizer
Problem --> Minimizer
Minimizer --> Result
Result --> CSVExport
Main --> Minimizer
Main --> CSVExport
Result --> Main